      "synthesis": {
        "main_text_has_explicit_synthesis": true,
        "si_used": false,
        "procedure": "CAN (3.0 g, 5.47 mmol) and tBuONa (3.16 g, 32.83 mmol) were combined in a Schlenk tube, THF (50 ml) was added, and the mixture was stirred at room temperature. After 2–3 h a yellow solution and colourless precipitate formed with evolution of NH3. Stirring was continued overnight; the green/brown solution was filtered and the volatiles were evaporated. The residue was dissolved in hexane and stored at −30 °C to isolate 2. X-ray-quality dark green blocks (and light green needles) were grown by slow cooling of a hot hexane solution to room temperature overnight; the blocks were washed with hexane and dried.",
