      "synthesis": {
        "main_text_has_explicit_synthesis": true,
        "si_used": false,
        "procedure": "Direct synthesis from [CeI3(THF)4]: to a mixture of [CeI3(THF)4] (400 mg, 0.49 mmol), KL (436 mg, 1.98 mmol), and benzoquinone (26.7 mg, 0.25 mmol) was added Et2O (30 ml). The emerald-green suspension was stirred over the weekend at room temperature, filtered, and the dark-green solid washed with Et2O (10 ml). Evaporation of the combined yellow filtrates gave a yellow solid that was washed with cold (−78 °C) hexane (5 ml) and dried in vacuo to give [CeL4] (200 mg, 47.2%). Related routes from Ce(OTf)4 with KL (mixture with [CeL3]) and from Ce(OTf)4/KL/benzoquinone (55–60% by NMR after hexane wash) are also reported.",
